شعر پارسی — license overview

This repository contains material under different terms:

1. Site code (HTML, CSS, JavaScript, service worker, manifest, icons):
   MIT License, text below.

2. Poem texts and book data in `data/`:
   Taken from Ganjoor's public export (https://github.com/ganjoor/ganjoor-data).
   They remain under Ganjoor's own terms and are not covered by the MIT License.
   The classical poems themselves are in the public domain; the edited texts and
   their arrangement are Ganjoor's work.

3. Font files in `fonts/` (Lateef, SIL Global):
   SIL Open Font License 1.1, see `fonts/OFL.txt`.

4. Poet portraits in `img/poets/`:
   Copyright (c) 2026 Navid Berahmand. All rights reserved.
   Not covered by the MIT License; do not reuse without permission.

